package ReviewCenter {
    part def ProjectPage {
        doc /* Pages that show one project to a user who may see it (a hidden project looks like a project that does not exist) with its reviews as rows, each with its approval status (Approved or In review), a link to the plan page when a repository of the project is enabled, Repositories, Audit trail, and Evidence settings buttons for whoever administers the project, and, for those administrators only (project admins and system administrators), a Review rules card with the switch that requires independent reviewers (saved from the loaded value, audited), the members of the project with their roles to change or remove and a button to add one; the separate pages to add an existing user by the exact user name and to create a local account for the project, which shows the generated temporary password once; the evidence settings page, where whoever administers the project switches anonymous access to the evidence index and the attestation PDFs (both off by default) and the content of the PDFs (discussion threads, reviewer names, checklist wording, file list and hashes, git context; all on by default) with regulatory and exposure warnings, saves them together with an audit entry, and refuses a stale save; and the separate page with the form to create a review from uploaded files or from an enabled git repository of the project (head revision, optional baseline revision, selection). Every handler re-checks access through the shared guard and clears loaded data when it is gone. */

        comment sourceRef /* Source: src/DemaConsulting.ReviewCenter/Web/ProjectPage.razor, ProjectPage.razor.cs, NewReviewPage.razor, NewReviewPage.razor.cs, NewMemberPage.razor, NewMemberPage.razor.cs, NewMemberAccountPage.razor, NewMemberAccountPage.razor.cs, EvidenceSettingsPage.razor, and EvidenceSettingsPage.razor.cs */
        comment testRef /* Test: test/DemaConsulting.ReviewCenter.Tests/Web/ProjectPageTests.cs, NewReviewPageRepositoryTests.cs, NewMemberPageTests.cs, NewMemberAccountPageTests.cs, and EvidenceSettingsPageTests.cs */
        comment designRef /* Design: docs/design/review-center/web/project-page.md */
        comment verificationRef /* Verification: docs/verification/review-center/web/project-page.md */
        comment reqRef /* Requirements: docs/reqstream/review-center/web/project-page.yaml */
    }
}
